r revisit the idea before creating more versions. Automation then protects a meaningful decision instead of multiplying an unexamined one."]}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"id":"deep-dive","className":"article-prose deep-dive","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Correct JSON can still publish the wrong thing"}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["A request can satisfy every field constraint while failing the editorial task. The asset may belong to another account, the caption may promise a feature the product lacks, or the chosen format may make the explanation unreadable. Schema validation catches structural mistakes; it cannot carry all the judgement embedded in a brief. Add semantic checks that compare the proposed action with the account promise, approved version and evidence. Make a mismatch visible before the operation reaches the publishing tool."]}]]}]],["$","figure",null,{"className":"editorial-diagram diagram-compare","children":[["$","figcaption",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mono acid","children":"THE IDEA, UNPACKED"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Validation has more than one layer"}]]}],["$","ol",null,{"className":"diagram-items","children":[["$","li","Syntax",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Syntax"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The request matches the tool's input contract."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Context",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Context"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Account, asset and destination match the brief."}],false]}]]}],["$","li","Meaning",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"diagram-index","children":"03"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Meaning"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The post makes a useful, supported promise."}],false]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"diagram-caption","children":"Editorial model: a way to reason about the process, not measured platform results."}]]}],[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","$19","0",{"children":[["$","p","0",{"children":["Do not respond by adding vague adjectives to every prompt. Give the workflow concrete references, forbidden claims and a small set of questions it must answer about the draft. Who is this for? What does the viewer learn? Which part of the post supports the promise? Which destination continues it? Keep a human review route for claims or assets that the system cannot verify. Automation becomes useful when it reduces repetitive work around a strong idea. It becomes slop when valid requests are mistaken for worthwhile communication."]}]]}]]}]]]}],false,false,"$L1a","$undefined","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e"]}],"$L1f"]}]
